      "text": {
        "jp": "うん。まだちょっとこわいけど、\r\nお兄ちゃんたちみたいにゆうきを出してみる。",
        "official_en": "Mmhm... I’m a little scared...but I’ll be brave...like you.",
        "real_en": "Yeah. I'm still a little scared, but I'll try to be brave like you guys."
